00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:02.736
is like focus on the
process, get your practice.

00:12:02.736 --> 00:12:04.330
And then the outcome is what it is.

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:07.550
And, you know, the more and ironically,

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:09.170
the more you get fixated on the outcome,

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:12.330
oftentimes the outcome won't be as good.

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.780
So that's, I think the
first thing and that's true.

00:12:14.780 --> 00:12:17.370
You know, I'm preaching it.

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:19.160
I don't practice it in
everything in my life.

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:21.270
But when I do whenever I'm
getting stressed about something,

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:22.430
I'm getting anxious about something,

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:23.824
I'm like, look, it's just the process now.

00:12:23.824 --> 00:12:26.610
Focus on what's in your locus of control,

00:12:26.610 --> 00:12:29.810
do it the best you can, and
then the world will turn out

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:30.850
the way it does.

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:33.405
No point in stressing about it.

00:12:33.405 --> 00:12:38.210
And then, you know, if I
were to continue to preach,

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:40.613
I would tell people don't you know,

00:12:41.518 --> 00:12:42.351
don't underestimate meditation.

00:12:42.351 --> 00:12:44.550
Even if you do 510 minutes
a day, sit quietly,

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:46.350
try to steal your mind, have fun with it.

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:49.780
Be curious, laugh about yourself,
when you get distracted.

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:51.182
You're gonna find that, you know,

00:12:51.182 --> 00:12:53.581
it's a lot harder to take, you know,

00:12:53.581 --> 00:12:56.570
a lot of things as seriously as sometimes

00:12:56.570 --> 00:12:58.363
we do in a good way, in a good way.

